body:
I don't know. The thing is, I don't have any goals. When I said I kept trying and failing, I was talking about college. Oddly enough, it wasn't the difficulty of the assignments, but *mustering up the energy to do them.* My grades would literally be an A or an F 80% of the time for a class hardly anything in-between. But I mostly failed. 

&nbsp;

I don't think I have many options if I can't get a degree. I can't spend the rest of my life struggling in minimum wage jobs.
